{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/cf6b399b21a8145ea830a11280ebb7d6.avif?t=1756749273\" width=1000 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pulp Action Shotgun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the style and the charm of retro pulp comics with the FPS world. With classic comic enemies like demonic worshippers, creatures from the deep and of course... the living dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.poster.avif?t=1756749273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.webm?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/9a258364d77dcc6990b22d1c6e73a89f.mp4?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Each Issue!</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is designed around an issue of a comic, try and find every hidden detail while being swarmed by the evil monsters of that world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.poster.avif?t=1756749273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.webm?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/65256f32ba6549c8f98b8f570a4b73be.mp4?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shotgun is Best Gun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why would you need anything other than a perfectly powerful Shotgun?  the only thing better than a Shotgun? TWO SHOTGUNS!!!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.poster.avif?t=1756749273\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.webm?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/45cb69fc0d9f12ee46603b9ff36db1ed.mp4?t=1756749273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/extras/d335b3a60b161b63bb5ffabc95a954f5.avif?t=1756749273\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451110?t=1756749273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451110?t=1756749273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/5cfa5d605a4d4923365380d88790c8303dfa7964/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756749273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451110/5cfa5d605a4d4923365380d88790c8303dfa7964/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756749273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":n